diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index a120f85..a4eca7f 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -1,75 +1,102 @@
-# Persian Barbershop WordPress
+# Barbershop WordPress Storefront
 
-A generalized, Persian-first RTL WordPress block theme with WooCommerce styling, a privacy-aware before/after portfolio plugin, and a safe local Docker development stack.
+A generalized Persian-first RTL WordPress and WooCommerce storefront for a modern barbershop. The visual system follows a professional navy, emerald, and white product-care direction while keeping all names, logos, contact values, products, and images editable.
 
-This repository is intentionally free of personal names, real contact information, customer data, merchant credentials, database dumps, production configuration, and private project history.
+## Implemented requirements
 
-## Included
+- **Very short customer registration:** first name, last name, email for login/recovery, and an optional phone number. Username and password are generated by WooCommerce; address and city are not part of the profile-registration flow.
+- **Easy cart access:** a large cart control in the header, an item-count badge, AJAX count updates, and a floating mobile cart button.
+- **Editable product taxonomy:** seeded categories for hair/beard styling, hair care, and skin care, including the requested subcategories.
+- **Large editable category icons:** each WooCommerce product category has a media-library icon field. The storefront uses large 7rem icon panels with accessible SVG fallbacks.
+- **Simple barber administration:** a Persian **راه‌اندازی فروشگاه** dashboard links directly to logo/site editing, product categories/icons, and product management.
+- **Editable logo:** the installer imports a neutral placeholder logo and sets it as the WordPress custom logo/site icon. It can be replaced in the Site Editor.
+- **WooCommerce editing:** products, prices, images, inventory, categories, order email, and homepage blocks are editable without source-code changes.
+- **Safe Docker deployment:** localhost development stack plus an optional Caddy/HTTPS production compose file.
+- **Automated quality:** secret scan, structural/design tests, PHP 7.4/8.2/8.3 linting, JavaScript checks, Docker configuration validation, package building, and a full Docker installation smoke test.
 
-- `theme/persian-barbershop` — dark charcoal, warm-white, and muted-gold block theme.
-- `plugin/barbershop-core` — managed before/after entries, publication-consent checks, and configurable new-order notification recipient.
-- `compose.yaml` — local-only WordPress and MariaDB environment using values from `.env`.
-- `tools/validate.py` — structure and policy checks.
-- `tools/scan-secrets.py` — conservative repository secret scanner.
+The source intentionally contains no real person, business, address, telephone, merchant, customer, or trademark identity.
 
-## Safe local setup
